        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9312, Raised Beading Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nJust like the animal after which this pull is named, the Cheetah Spot Cabinet Knob is covered in spots. These spots really bring out the wild side of this RK International made knob, making it the ideal choice for people who love big cats. It is available in 5 finishes, all of which really accentuate the decorative indents. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9312 Slim Egg Knob with Indents:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-3/8</li>\r\n<li>Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
